  "body": "ONE SOLD! JUST TWO HOMES REMAINING - STUNNING!\r\n\r\n23C Carlisle Road showcase contemporary design, quality craftsmanship and thoughtful attention to detail, delivering the space, style and comfort today's buyers are looking for. Beautifully appointed and designed for modern living, these standalone residences offer a wonderful balance of generous interiors, effortless functionality and relaxed coastal appeal.\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover light-filled living spaces, stylish kitchens, quality finishes and seamless connections to outdoor entertaining. Whether enjoying time with family, hosting friends or simply relaxing at home, these properties have been designed to make everyday living feel effortless.\r\n\r\nTWO HOMES. TWO EXCEPTIONAL OPPORTUNITIES.\r\n\r\n* 4 generous bedrooms, 4 bathrooms (all ensuite) \r\n* Open plan dining/kitchen with quality finishes plus Butlers Pantry - electric and gas hob\r\n* Spacious separate living with balcony\r\n* Elevated master suite with walk-in wardrobe and fabulous ensuite\r\n* Separate downstairs teenagers' retreat with its own deck\r\n* Double internal-access garaging and laundry\r\n* 10 year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nLocation is everything, and here you can enjoy the very best of the Browns Bay lifestyle. Stroll to the beautiful beach, enjoy the village cafés and restaurants, browse the local shops or make the most of the excellent everyday amenities nearby.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the choice of highly regarded schools, including Browns Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Northcross Intermediate and Rangitoto College.\r\n\r\nBrand-new quality, impressive design and a superb coastal setting make these homes an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nCall today to arrange your private viewing. Short-notice appointments welcome.",
